溪渔隐卷二首 其一","author":"张弼","text":"紫笠青蓑绿竹竿，舒溪石上坐荒寒。\n幽情尽付沧浪咏，写向菰蒲叶上看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30853,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题舒溪渔隐卷二首 其二","author":"张弼","text":"春水桃花双鲤鱼，老姜新酒付行厨。\n丁宁童子休轻剖，甫里先生恐寄书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30854,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"至张家湾柬陈嘉谟冬官主事二首 其一","author":"张弼","text":"才离艨艟又僦车，客行巳喜近京华。\n元龙是我同年契，濯足清醪肯为赊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30855,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"至张家湾柬陈嘉谟冬官主事二首 其二","author":"张弼","text":"麻衣归去又重来，月色团员四十回。\n萧飒吟髭今半白，故人相见莫惊猜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30856,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"道中索书者甚夥有涉水攀舷拜索恳至者余皆执笔应之至河西务将登陆而舟师又以十纸请予既为书作四句自笑云","author":"张弼","text":"山阴老妪初惜扇，得价重来不与书。\n我怪右军胸次隘，随求随与又何如。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30857,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同都谏张裕夫致斋太庙夜书千文赠之系之以诗","author":"张弼","text":"元龙跳跃墨池云，十五年前曾许君。\n今夜始能酬旧约，清斋不必换鹅群。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30858,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄陈永叔","author":"张弼","text":"楼上先生不下楼，酒尊诗卷自优游。\n从他白日无情甚，纵尔清閒也白头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30859,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送客","author":"张弼","text":"绿杨红杏碧萝天，长篴短箫催画船。\n日暮酒醒人巳远，空教啼鸟怨流年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30860,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄友","author":"张弼","text":"去年今日棘闱中，文笔相辉气吐虹。\n今日思君更千里，独凭轩槛溯长风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30861,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"勉鹧鸪叟","author":"张弼","text":"丈夫应不厌幽栖，窗下诗书天上梯。\n只恐青春易抛掷，落花撩乱鸟空啼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30862,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题屈原图","author":"张弼","text":"香消兰蕙暮云深，宿莽萧萧遍水浔。\n歌罢离骚见渔父，坐来聊话独醒心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30863,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄郑蕃先生","author":"张弼","text":"文采风流郑子真，乍交浑若故交人。\n归舟风雨相思梦，多在钓滩烟水滨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30864,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寿程夫人六十","author":"张弼","text":"凤冠昔日谒椒房，袖惹天家万寿香。\n更待数回花甲转，重来拜献九霞觞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30865,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题荣寿卷","author":"张弼","text":"青云轩冕白云居，醉看黄花静看书。\n不用仙人餐玉法，悠肰自过百年馀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30866,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题谢文晖画","author":"张弼","text":"青衫乌帽走黄尘，孤负溪山几度春。\n今日为君图画里，妒他风月属閒人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30867,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题太白像","author":"张弼","text":"锡宴璚林荷宠光，蹇驴驮醉任斜阳。\n谁知醒后狂猋起，老泪吹残滴夜郎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30868,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题莺莺像","author":"张弼","text":"张生薄倖误婵娟，狼籍东风几百年。\n争似窦家双白璧，心悬日月照遗编。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30869,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梁园赏花四首 其一","author":"张弼","text":"鲜飙破阴阴复霁，柏屏槐盖凝花气。\n牡丹阑珊芍药芳，锦云遮花留青帝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30870,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梁园赏花四首 其二","author":"张弼","text":"花柳相依鱼鸟亲，乾坤容我醉吟身。\n锦笺綵笔风流句，囊括城南十里春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c0