3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题黄菊","author":"张弼","text":"菊有佳名独擅芳，九重天子御袍黄。\n远臣得见穷山里，正想氤氲满眼香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30896,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题大士","author":"张弼","text":"黄金殿下清卿笔，白华山前大士身。\n忽肰出现金莲寺，不堕人间万劫尘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30897,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"喜客至","author":"张弼","text":"吟风弄月台前草，为见客来青更好。\n载酒频过莫问奇，眼中尽是寻常道。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30898,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄节推韩驭民","author":"张弼","text":"金尊银烛醉西堂，舞袖翻风拂雨凉。\n今夜相思对明月，计程应巳到南昌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30899,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赴榕树湾避暑道中口号","author":"张弼","text":"触暑行行将避暑，左右烝徒汗如雨。\n何如高卧北窗风，时与圣贤相对语。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30900,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄大行人姚世昌使暹罗二首 其一","author":"张弼","text":"芙蓉江上饯东风，梅岭南来望去鸿。\n闻说近来消息好，海波一碧玉壶空。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30901,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄大行人姚世昌使暹罗二首 其二","author":"张弼","text":"郡衙襦裤两孩提，也辱先生一命题。\n为报近来粗识字，时分风栗觅霜梨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30902,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"得姚世昌之报","author":"张弼","text":"报道吾家第二郎，浙闱帘外踏秋香。\n又驰行李趋金阙，此际相将过大江。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30903,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠筮师陆以诚","author":"张弼","text":"红尘市里碧云帘，静对炉薰玩易占。\n尺短寸长浑不计，炯然天地一明蟾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30904,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"饮陈千兵于云封寺","author":"张弼","text":"云封寺里避游尘，歌舞萧娘却是真。\n万叠江枫浑是醉，醉眸疑是艳阳春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30905,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"平梅岭二首 其一","author":"张弼","text":"梅关新甃磴层层，步入云霄不觉升。\n昔日盐车垂耳者，四蹄风雨足奔腾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30906,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"平梅岭二首 其二","author":"张弼","text":"廿五里街如砥平，东西行李往来轻。\n寄声海外诸番国，王道平平正好行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30907,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宝珠山","author":"张弼","text":"近治江山巳遍游，独遗此景古城陬。\n酒霞墨雨从今到，应使山灵笑点头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30908,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"旭山亭","author":"张弼","text":"九日山前十月游，黄花红叶最宜秋。\n虽然未尽三公醉，也向禅林捧茗瓯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30909,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"资寿山","author":"张弼","text":"上犹城外白云扉，此日曾来一解衣。\n为见子衿聊问讯，春风几度紫蔷薇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30910,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"鸭子湖","author":"张弼","text":"红光明灭龙珠巷，绿水瀰漫鸭子湖。\n十里春风迎去旆，一庭松影叫提壶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30911,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"曲江张九龄祠","author":"张弼","text":"瞻衮亭连礼锡亭，曲江俛首伴山僧。\n于今独立云霄上，无复梅花怨不平。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30912,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宝积寺","author":"张弼","text":"十笏禅房十笏台，香烟花气共裴回。\n叮咛莫放游尘到，点破窗前紫翠苔。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30913,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"又和东坡韵","author":"张弼","text":"腹怕饥兮身怕寒，空盂老衲每相关。\n满头霜露听鸡唱，一入空门不得閒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30914,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"典教寺","author":"张弼","text":"城南野寺啼钩辀，分明唤我踏青游。\n又值提壶苦相劝，东风今日醉遨头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30915,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舞剑台","author":"张弼","text":"舞剑台前倾玉壶，梧桐花飘雪片粗。\n且须沈醉休言别，别后相思万里途。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30916,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"苏步坊","author":"张弼","text":"东坡过此偶行行，此地遂留苏步名。\n何事章惇瘗毛骨，子孙羞认是先茔。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30917,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过乌岐铺","author":"张弼","text":"白莽黄茆没马头，万山深处见孤邮。\n平生正为多岐惑，闻道乌岐更可愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30918,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"庭湖","author":"张弼","text":"雁过衡山又北飞，槱迟湖上稻梁肥。\n苏卿郝使今何在，嬴得往来无是非。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30919,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"芝草","author":"张弼","text":"佛刹灵芝呈上瑞，黉宫举子破天荒。\n西方也服中原化，相送英贤佐圣皇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30920,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游虎丘寺送别","author":"张弼","text":"海涌峰头万顷云，天风鹏背忽逢君。\n此行巳是蓬莱客，袖得还丹与我分。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30921,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过梅岭","author":"张弼","text":"凿山开道曲江公，古庙遗墟草莽中。\n我有瓣香无处祝，裴回松下溯吟风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30922,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"七月廿一日再过梅岭","author":"张弼","text":"去年骑马黄沙岭，正在燕山北尽头。\n今日又从梅岭过，八千里路思悠悠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30923,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九月廿二日家人插榴花梨花口号","author":"张弼","text":"重阳节后西风来，梨花榴花烂熳开。\n为怜黄菊真可愧，冷淡含香待雨催。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30924,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}}]